ок для тих, хто цінує стиль і практичність!</p>', 1, '2026-02-11 03:22:21', '["products\\/3729\\/sumki-tout-paket-zi-shkiri-tout-ms-amag-58087.webp","products\\/3729\\/sumki-tout-paket-zi-shkiri-tout-ms-amag-62523.webp","products\\/3729\\/sumki-tout-paket-zi-shkiri-tout-ms-amag-41529.webp","products\\/3729\\/sumki-tout-paket-zi-shkiri-tout-ms-amag-34752.webp","products\\/3729\\/sumki-tout-paket-zi-shkiri-tout-ms-amag-44283.webp","products\\/3729\\/sumki-tout-paket-zi-shkiri-tout-ms-amag-68883.webp","products\\/3729\\/sumki-tout-paket-zi-shkiri-tout-ms-amag-23799.webp","products\\/3729\\/sumki-tout-paket-zi-shkiri-tout-ms-amag-51628.webp","products\\/3729\\/sumki-tout-paket-zi-shkiri-tout-ms-amag-63672.webp","products\\/3729\\/sumki-tout-paket-zi-shkiri-tout-ms-amag-16801.webp","products\\/3729\\/sumki-tout-paket-zi-shkiri-tout-ms-amag-3732.webp","products\\/3729\\/sumki-tout-paket-zi-shkiri-tout-ms-amag-58524.webp","products\\/3729\\/sumki-tout-paket-zi-shkiri-tout-ms-amag-57600.webp","products\\/3729\\/sumki-tout-paket-zi-shkiri-tout-ms-amag-54316.webp","products\\/3729\\/sumki-tout-paket-zi-shkiri-tout-ms-amag-60438.webp","products\\/3729\\/sumki-tout-paket-zi-shkiri-tout-ms-amag-53894.webp","products\\/3729\\/sumki-tout-paket-zi-shkiri-tout-ms-amag-71468.webp"]', '["products\\/3729\\/sumki-tout-paket-zi-shkiri-tout-ms-amag-58087.webp","products\\/3729\\/sumki-tout-paket-zi-shkiri-tout-ms-amag-62523.webp","products\\/3729\\/sumki-tout-paket-zi-shkiri-tout-ms-amag-41529.webp","products\\/3729\\/sumki-tout-paket-zi-shkiri-tout-ms-amag-34752.webp","products\\/3729\\/sumki-tout-paket-zi-shkiri-tout-ms-amag-44283.webp","products\\/3729\\/sumki-tout-paket-zi-shkiri-tout-ms-amag-68883.webp","products\\/3729\\/sumki-tout-paket-zi-shkiri-tout-ms-amag-23799.webp","products\\/3729\\/sumki-tout-paket-zi-shkiri-tout-ms-amag-51628.webp","products\\/3729\\/sumki-tout-paket-zi-shkiri-tout-ms-amag-63672.webp","products\\/3729\\/sumki-tout-paket-zi-shkiri-tout-ms-amag-16801.webp","